      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_39",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("story/landscape-castle.webp"),
            text: _("Ay, the Sceptre of Fire. The Sceptre has a long, glorious, and fearful history. But I am not here to tell you how the jewel within it was brought over the ocean by Haldric the Great, nor will I tell the story of Garard I and the challenge he set, nor that of Konrad, King of Wesnoth by virtue of the Sceptre."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_40",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("I am here to tell you of its making. Of its crafting, deep in the caverns of dwarfdom. And of the dwarves who made it; for they were great, they were. They are counted among the greatest of the heroes of ancient Knalga."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_41",
